1
00:00:00,401 --> 00:00:04,241
Campus parking should start with a clear price and a clear next step.

2
00:00:04,761 --> 00:00:08,361
This is Solvia, a hackathon demo using fictional adults and PayPal

3
00:00:08,361 --> 00:00:09,481
sandbox funds.

4
00:00:12,704 --> 00:00:14,684
Maria is a student at Fresno City College.

5
00:00:14,984 --> 00:00:18,424
She describes her vehicle in one sentence and chooses a term permit.

6
00:00:26,734 --> 00:00:30,354
Together's Qwen model reads the vehicle details, but Maria reviews

7
00:00:30,354 --> 00:00:31,974
every field before saving.

8
00:00:32,674 --> 00:00:36,134
The AI never chooses her college, permit type, or price.

9
00:00:40,675 --> 00:00:44,775
Solvia shows the published $30 fee and the permit dates before checking

10
00:00:44,775 --> 00:00:45,315
out.

11
00:00:49,576 --> 00:00:51,876
Here are the actual PayPal checkout options.

12
00:00:59,808 --> 00:01:03,388
For this recording, an automated test harness approves an official

13
00:01:03,388 --> 00:01:06,488
sandbox test card through PayPal's REST API.

14
00:01:07,108 --> 00:01:09,108
This does not demonstrate a wallet login.

15
00:01:09,928 --> 00:01:12,608
Solvia then captures the payment through its own back end.

16
00:01:17,839 --> 00:01:21,679
The permit becomes live only after PayPal confirms a completed capture.

17
00:01:22,399 --> 00:01:25,359
The receipt shows the real order and capture references.

18
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,960
Maria downloads her printable permit and can find it again in my

19
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:32,360
permits.

20
00:01:41,463 --> 00:01:45,663
Its public verification link confirms validity without exposing her

21
00:01:45,663 --> 00:01:46,123
plate.

22
00:01:49,847 --> 00:01:51,347
Visitors can choose a day pass.

23
00:01:51,807 --> 00:01:55,527
The form hides semester choices and the review shows the actual daily

24
00:01:55,527 --> 00:01:57,187
price and one day dates.

25
00:02:06,837 --> 00:02:08,557
Elena is an employee in this demo.

26
00:02:09,077 --> 00:02:12,637
Her exempt permit is issued without a PayPal charge and it has its

27
00:02:12,637 --> 00:02:13,677
own printable proof.

28
00:02:25,859 --> 00:02:29,779
Solvia combines AI assisted entry with human review, deterministic

29
00:02:29,779 --> 00:02:31,699
pricing, and verified payment records.

30
00:02:32,239 --> 00:02:34,159
Clear prices, confident next steps.
